Raw: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/moby/profiles/refs/tags/seccomp/v0.2.3/seccomp/default.json
SHA-256: 536529b665dd0972c37bfb569f5d4ac8a53592e7b00752bc39ff063ca9864c74

This is the tagged Moby default deny-by-default seccomp profile. AI Guard pins
the complete profile instead of replacing Docker's baseline with an allow-by-
default denylist. The parser additionally runs with no network, no capabilities,
no new privileges, a read-only root, non-root UID, and bounded resources.
